\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. I know that my Redeemer lives,
\par And ever prays for me;
\par A token of His love He gives,
\par A pledge of liberty.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. I find Him lifting up my head,
\par He brings salvation near,
\par His presence makes me free indeed,
\par And He will soon appear.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. He wills that I should only be;
\par What can withstand His will?
\par The counsel of grace in me
\par He surely shall fulfil.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Jesus, I hang upon Thy word;
\par I steadfastly believe
\par Thou wilt return and claim me, Lord,
\par And to Thyself receive.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5
\par \cf0\ulnone\b0 5. When God is mine, and I am His
\par Of paradise possessed,
\par I taste unutterable bliss
\par And everlasting rest.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

